've withdrawn our 2020 guidance until we have more clarity into the impact of the pandemic.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/09/american-homes-4-rent-amh-q1-2020-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"AMH 2020 Q2","e":"amh","d":"2020-08-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bryan Smith","x":"As a reminder, we maintain most of the utilities in our name and pass-through the charges to our residents.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/08/american-homes-4-rent-amh-q2-2020-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"AMH 2020 Q2","e":"amh","d":"2020-08-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John E. Corrigan","x":"We have seen some cost savings in other areas.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/08/american-homes-4-rent-amh-q2-2020-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"AMH 2020 Q3","e":"amh","d":"2020-11-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bryan Smith","x":"We saw fantastic increases in applications per rent-ready property in the third quarter, up almost 100% from 2019, and that's translating into some really good pricing power.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/06/american-homes-4-rent-amh-q3-2020-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"AMH 2020 Q3","e":"amh","d":"2020-11-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bryan Smith","x":"So we see that pricing power continuing into next year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/06/american-homes-4-rent-amh-q3-2020-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"AMH 2020 Q4","e":"amh","d":"2021-02-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bryan Smith","x":"And we expect our pricing power to continue throughout 2021, with full-year blended leasing spreads in the 5% range.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/26/american-homes-4-rent-amh-q4-2020-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"AMH 2021 Q1","e":"amh","d":"2021-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bryan Smith","x":"And that's really giving us the pricing power that you're seeing now.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/07/american-homes-4-rent-amh-q1-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"AMH 2021 Q1","e":"amh","d":"2021-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bryan Smith","x":"So there are a number of good things that are giving us that pricing power.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/07/american-homes-4-rent-amh-q1-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"AMH 2021 Q2","e":"amh","d":"2021-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David P. Singelyn","x":"As you inferred there is a little bit of price increases in the supply chain, but the rents have more than -- taken care of that the increase in rent.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/06/american-homes-4-rent-amh-q2-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"AMH 2021 Q2","e":"amh","d":"2021-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jack Corrigan","x":"Our 12,000 lots owned and controlled enables us to raise our guidance to 13,000 to 15,000 lots owned or controlled by the end of the year, putting us in a position to expand our development deliveries in future years.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/06/american-homes-4-rent-amh-q2-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"AMH 2021 Q3","e":"amh","d":"2021-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bryan Smith","x":"So we're still seeing really good pricing power especially in the time of year where traditionally we've seen some seasonality.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/06/american-homes-4-rent-amh-q3-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"AMH 2021 Q3","e":"amh","d":"2021-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Haendel St. Juste","x":"So maybe can you talk about pricing power renewal pricing strategy?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/06/american-homes-4-rent-amh-q3-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"AMH 2021 Q3","e":"amh","d":"2021-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"man